  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to the EU-PNG Partnership for Good Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purposes of this contract are as follows: 1)Supporting a more gender-responsive governance, integrity, and sound, transparent and accountable management in the judicial system; 2)Improving capacities of the Village Courts to peacefully mediate and solve conflicts; 3)Supporting a more gender-responsive governance, integrity and sound, transparent and accountable management in law enforcement.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
